on-empty subsets of $T$ where every element of $T$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4,6,8},{10}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{0,2,4,6,8,10,12}}$ is not a partition because the element $12$ does not appear in $T.$\n\n- ${{0,10},{2},{4,8}}$ is not a partition because the element $6\\in T$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- ${{0,10},{2,4,6,8,10}}$ is not a partition because the element $10$ appears in two subsets." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-50e0add4-d87e-54cf-8530-185be76bcd24"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-50e0add4-d87e-54cf-8530-185be76bcd24" :answer-field/id #uuid "50e0add4-d87e-54cf-8530-185be76bcd24" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e63004bd-dc80-596b-9550-3d149c208b61" :answer-field/choices ["answer-cc423c96-b8aa-516c-883d-cdb7d4c75d2f" "answer-e63004bd-dc80-596b-9550-3d149c208b61" "answer-5c869bde-8a87-5024-ac95-04df9e93eeca" "answer-9843bcf8-699e-5c71-9c74-72e5fb9038a1" "answer-766d6cca-ff04-5de7-9394-8db047eb43ef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cc423c96-b8aa-516c-883d-cdb7d4c75d2f" :answer/id #uuid "cc423c96-b8aa-516c-883d-cdb7d4c75d2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,10},{2,4,6,8,10}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e63004bd-dc80-596b-9550-3d149c208b61" :answer/id #uuid "e63004bd-dc80-596b-9550-3d149c208b61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,10},{2,4,6,8}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5c869bde-8a87-5024-ac95-04df9e93eeca" :answer/id #uuid "5c869bde-8a87-5024-ac95-04df9e93eeca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,10},{2},{4,8,10}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9843bcf8-699e-5c71-9c74-72e5fb9038a1" :answer/id #uui